{{Documentation}}
[[Category:Pages using tooltips]]
==Usage==
<pre>
{{Tooltip
|{{4}}
|class = lineup-slot-info
|data-unitname = {{1}}
|data-level = {{2}}
|data-talents = {{3}}
}}
</pre>
*<code><nowiki>{{1}}</nowiki></code> is the name of the unit in the slot.
*<code><nowiki>{{2}}</nowiki></code> is the level of the unit in the slot.
*<code><nowiki>{{3}}</nowiki></code> is any details about the talents that the unit requires in a strategy.
*<code><nowiki>{{4}}</nowiki></code> is the content that will be wrapped such that hovering over will show this template.

This template is used for the popups in the [[Template:Lineup|Lineup template]] inside a span tag to show details (unit name, level, and talents) about a unit in a lineup. The level and talents parameters are not supplied when unnecessary.

==Example==
<tabber>
Only Unit=
<pre>
{{Tooltip
|[[File:Uni037 s00.png|80px]]
|class = lineup-slot-info
|data-unitname = Jiangshi Cat
}}
</pre>

